# More info: https://docs.docker.com/engine/reference/builder/#dockerignore-file

# Ignore test files
**/*_test.go

# Auxiliary configuration and documentation files should also be ignored
**/*.yml
**/*.yaml
**/*.txt
**/bin/
# Kubebuilder manifests only — do not use **/config/ (that hides Go packages such as internal/config).
may/config/
drivers/*/config/
**/*.md
**/Makefile
**/PROJECT
**/Dockerfile
**/.dockerignore
**/.gitignore
test/
demo/
